<!-- 500, the lab's first room. Door 1 is the lift up to 310. The lab needs
     three MO disks (509, 507 and 510's computers): 503's, 30F's and 217's.
     Once 217's is taken (item flag bank 7 0x4D clears; flags are global, so
     the gate reads from here) nothing in the lab needs anything from before
     it, and the bot never goes back. While that disk still lies in the
     library the lift stays open: a disk left behind on a full inventory
     lost 510's lamp, and the run looped in the lab. -->
<bot format="2">
  <avoid slot="1" bank="7" bit="0x4D" while="clear" reason="the lift back up to 310: once 217's MO disk is taken the lab needs nothing from before it"/>
</bot>
